  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hanoi sustainable urban transport program &#xbf; metro line 3 extension, phase 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant will finance the implementation of the feasibility study for the extension of Hanoi Metro Line 3 as well as technical support for the development of an integrated urban transport system in the city.The total eligible cost indicated includes the EU contribution and a contribution from a Trust Fund - co-financed by AFD, and managed by ADB of USD 0.75 M, equivalent to EUR 0.7 M. This TA will support Hanoi authority in preparing the bidding documents and the bidding process.</narrative>
  </description>
